sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Player
    participant Web as Browser game
    participant API as Game API / relayer
    participant Prover as Private ZK prover
    participant Walrus
    participant Sui as Sui Move canonical state
    participant G16 as Native Sui Groth16
    participant Seal as Seal key servers

    Player->>Web: Select suspect, room, weapon, and time
    Web->>Web: Salt fields and create accusation commitment
    Note over Web,Sui: Plaintext accusation fields are never published onchain
    Web->>API: Accusation commitment + private proof job
    API->>Prover: Private accusation, committed case, session, attempt nonce
    Note over Prover: Proof binds case commitment, accusation commitment,<br/>session, attempt nonce, and verdict commitment
    Prover-->>API: Proof + verdict commitment + minimal verdict capsule
    Note over API: Capsule contains only result bit and commitment-opening data
    API->>API: Encrypt capsule
    API->>Walrus: Store ciphertext only
    Walrus-->>API: Blob reference
    API->>Sui: Submit proof, verdict commitment, blob reference
    Sui->>G16: Verify expected key and bound public inputs

    alt Proof verification fails
        G16-->>Sui: Invalid
        Sui-->>API: Abort; no terminal state
    else Proof valid
        G16-->>Sui: Valid
        Sui->>Sui: Record terminal state and VerdictRecord
        Sui-->>API: Confirmed execution / finality
        Player->>Web: Request final verdict
        Web->>Walrus: Fetch ciphertext by recorded blob reference
        Walrus-->>Web: Ciphertext
        Web->>Seal: Request decryption for session identity
        Seal->>Sui: Evaluate Sui-defined seal_approve policy
        Note over Seal,Sui: Require correct player, terminal session, matching blob + commitment,<br/>and correct protocol / level version

        alt Pre-terminal access or unauthorized player
            Sui-->>Seal: Deny
            Seal-->>Web: No decryption material
        else Policy allows
            Sui-->>Seal: Allow
            Seal-->>Web: Authorized decryption material
            Web->>Web: Authenticate and decrypt ciphertext
            alt Modified ciphertext
                Web-->>Player: Deny; render no verdict
            else Ciphertext authentic
                Web->>Web: Validate version, session, nonce, and commitment opening
                alt Incorrect commitment opening
                    Web-->>Player: Deny; render no verdict
                else Opening valid
                    Web-->>Player: Render YES or NO only
                end
            end
        end
    end
